SCOPE: SOFTWARE vs. BUNDLED REFERENCE DATA
================================================================================

The Apache License 2.0 in LICENSE covers the SOFTWARE in this repository — the
Go modules under internal/, pkg/, cmd/ and tools/, the Conjure contracts under
api/, the migrations under migrations/, the generated SDKs under clients/, and
the optional Next.js console under web/.

It does NOT cover the bundled REFERENCE DATA. The pinax reference-plane presets
